            {
                "entry_id": "54bf7ee1-59da-3f5b-89bf-ce09a34b45e3",
                "word": "za",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0a4dd753-2eed-479a-9b2a-552ed1692129",
                        "entry_id": "54bf7ee1-59da-3f5b-89bf-ce09a34b45e3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "zas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87f75f6f-2bde-3c8b-a1a8-9b91e02a2c3f",
                        "entry_id": "54bf7ee1-59da-3f5b-89bf-ce09a34b45e3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pizza."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "countable",
                            "slang",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2578cfe4-62a2-46c3-9c19-5d3bd5525fc8",
                                "sense_id": "87f75f6f-2bde-3c8b-a1a8-9b91e02a2c3f",
                                "text": "In fact, not ordering a SUB or ZA (pizza) is almost impossible since places to eat in Sackville include Subway (subs), Ed's (subs), Joey's (subs and za), Pizza Delight (mostly za), The Snack Shop (subs and za) and One Plus One (subs and za)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb2149ea-d459-4044-a9f4-e5b11c30ccd2",
                                "sense_id": "87f75f6f-2bde-3c8b-a1a8-9b91e02a2c3f",
                                "text": "But Chris, using some of his dated terminology, insisted that he wanted \"za\" for dinner. Back when Chris was a youngster in college, \"za\" was short for pizza--as if pizza were a lengthy word needing abbreviating."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4019bb0e-e4c9-42a2-99a8-c480dcc0a2ef",
                                "sense_id": "87f75f6f-2bde-3c8b-a1a8-9b91e02a2c3f",
                                "text": "They call me the Za-Lord."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "37f410e8-a330-3760-a7a1-8f8e2181eb35",
                "word": "za",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
